        <body>
            <div xml:id="d742">

                <pb facs="0734" n="1468" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1468"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Terrell.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>What is the situation of Harpoot indemnity; also of Marash indemnity?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
